 - Power                                                                                        1 ◐
   ◐ awake  ?  engine stopped  → station engine start
 - Guards                                                                                       4 ●
   ● battery    80% · AC attached  ends a session at 20% on battery
   ● low power  off                ends a session when it turns on
   ● thermal    nominal            ends a session at serious, or heavy for 5m lid closed on battery
   ● lid        open               closing it on battery ends a --lid session without --battery
 - Reading
   lid        open
   source     AC · 80% · not charging
   low power  off
   thermal    nominal (0)
 ↑↓ move  a awake  s sleep  enter detail  / filter  space fold  r reload  q quit  ? keys
